# A @repair name that is not a token of the parser grammar is reported where
# it is written.
# error: repair_unknown_token.grammar:18:16:
# error: @repair: SEMI is not a token the parser grammar uses
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser

top!  = IDENT                               → (top 1)

@repair
    holes      SEMI
